<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words" node=3D"[object Object]" style=3D"whi=
te-space: pre-wrap;">Budget Sector SWOT Analysis</p>
<ol dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Traditional Party Hostels (e.g., Costa R=
ica Backpackers)</li>
</ol>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Strengths: High guest volume, massive al=
cohol margins, low initial build-out costs, built-in social marketing throu=
gh word-of-mouth.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Weaknesses: Extreme wear-and-tear on fac=
ilities, noise complaints from neighbors, high staff turnover due to party =
environment, entirely dependent on backpacker seasons.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Opportunities: Packaging full-country tr=
avel routes (selling shuttle tickets to the next party hostel).</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Threats: Aging out of Gen Z preferences =
(who currently favor quieter, aesthetic spaces), strict local municipal liq=
uor license crackdowns.</li>
</ul>
<ol dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary" start=3D"2">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Modern "Poshtels" (Boutique / Digital No=
mad Focus)</li>
</ol>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Strengths: Commands premium room rates, =
attracts older/wealthier demographics with higher disposable income, insula=
ted against low-season due to long-term digital nomad stays.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Weaknesses: Massive initial capex for pr=
emium design (custom carpentry, high-end mattresses), sky-high utility bill=
s (AC and enterprise fiber internet are mandatory).</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Opportunities: Corporate retreats, co-wo=
rking day passes for locals, high-margin wellness upsells (yoga, specialty =
coffee).</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Threats: Rapid market saturation (Selina=
 and similar brands dominate this space), faster aesthetic aging (trendy de=
signs look dated in 5 years).</li>
</ul>
<ol dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary" start=3D"3">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Rural / Eco-Hostels (Monteverde, Osa Pen=
insula)</li>
</ol>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Strengths: Very low real estate acquisit=
ion costs, unique branding, massive revenue from tour commissions (hostels =
easily take 15% to 25% cuts on $100+ guided hikes and ziplines).</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Weaknesses: Highly vulnerable to the rai=
ny season (roads wash out, killing occupancy), expensive pest control and m=
old mitigation, off-grid utility challenges.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Opportunities: Permaculture courses, far=
m-to-table dining upsells, volunteer-to-stay labor exchanges (though legall=
y gray in CR).</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Threats: Climate change disrupting local=
 micro-climates, infrastructure failures (bridge collapses blocking tourist=
 access).</li>
</ul>
<ol dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary" start=3D"4">
