 tax shield.</p>
<h2 dir=3D"auto" class=3D"font-semibold text-2xl mt-[1.5em] max-md:font-dis=
play max-md:text-heading-2 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0.17px] m=
ax-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">What lodging can even=
 apply</h2>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">ICT=E2=80=99s current contract table (the operational gate, not a=
 blog):</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Hotels: <strong class=3D"font-semibold">=
10 rooms</strong></li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Country houses, cabins <strong class=3D"=
font-semibold">and hostels (albergues): 7 rooms</strong></li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Apart-hotels: 7</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Guest houses / pensiones: 5</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Rural tourism lodge: 3</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Term for lodging: <strong class=3D"font-semibold">7 years.</stron=
g><a href=3D"https://www.ict.go.cr/en/institutional-services/tourism-contra=
ct-requirements.html" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer nofollow=
" class=3D"no-copy ms-1 inline text-nowrap print:hidden py-[2.5px] ps-2 pe-=
2 rounded-full align-[0.5px] bg-surface-l1 text-[13px] leading-none font-me=
dium !text-fg-secondary hover:!text-fg-primary visited:text-fg-secondary fo=
cus:outline-none !no-underline hover:!no-underline citation" data-state=3D"=
closed">=E2=81=A0Ict</a></p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">The newer <em>Reglamento de Empresas de Hospedaje Tur=C3=ADstico<=
/em> (the 44256-era rewrite that replaced the 1980 decree) tried to simplif=
y typologies: most non-hotel lodging can be as small as <strong class=3D"fo=
nt-semibold">3 rooms</strong>, hotels stay at 10. Those rooms are defined w=
ith <strong class=3D"font-semibold">ba=C3=B1o privado</strong>. =E2=80=9CAl=
bergue=E2=80=9D in ICT language is a rooming typology, not =E2=80=9C70 bunk=
s and a shared bathroom down the hall.=E2=80=9D<a href=3D"https://pgrweb.go=
.cr/scij/Busqueda/Normativa/Normas/nrm_texto_completo.aspx?param1=3DNRTC&am=
p;nValor1=3D1&amp;nValor2=3D100937&amp;nValor3=3D138657&amp;strTipM=3DTC" t=
arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer nofollow" class=3D"no-copy ms-1=
 inline text-nowrap print:hidden py-[2.5px] ps-2 pe-2 rounded-full align-[0=
.5px] bg-surface-l1 text-[13px] leading-none font-medium !text-fg-secondary=
 hover:!text-fg-primary visited:text-fg-secondary focus:outline-none !no-un=
derline hover:!no-underline citation" data-state=3D"closed">=E2=81=A0Pgrweb=
</a></p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">That is the sharp edge for a Costa Rica Backpackers replica. A mi=
xed house with private rooms plus shared-bath dorms may get a declaration a=
s lodging. It may <strong class=3D"font-semibold">not</strong> sail through=
 a contract file if ICT classifies the inventory as failing the private-bat=
h unit count. Counsel and an architect need to map <em>habitaciones</em> be=
fore anyone models duty-free mattresses.</p>
<h2 dir=3D"auto" class=3D"font-semibold text-2xl mt-[1.5em] max-md:font-dis=
play max-md:text-heading-2 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0.17px] m=
ax-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">What Art. 7 still off=
ers hotels =E2=80=94 and what later laws cut</h2>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Current hospitality menu in Art. 7(a), as ICT actually administer=
s it:</p>
<ol dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Exemptio=
n from taxes and surcharges</strong> on import <strong class=3D"font-semibo=
ld">or local purchase</strong> of goods indispensable to install a new comp=
any, or to add new services / expand / remodel an existing one.<br><strong =
class=3D"font-semibold">Carve-out: motor vehicles and fuel.</strong></li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">IVA / sa=
les-tax relief only on the initial investment</strong> =E2=80=94 essential =
goods and construction materials to put the project in operation. Law 8114 =
(4 July 2001) Art. 18 narrowed the old open-ended sales-tax holiday to that=
 initial slice. Procuradur=C3=ADa C-208-2019 later said that 8114 exemption=
 was <strong class=3D"font-semibold">not tacitly killed</strong> by Law 963=
5=E2=80=99s IVA rewrite =E2=80=94 so it still matters for a <em>new</em> co=
ntract, but it is capex timing, not a 7-year operating IVA holiday on room =
nights.<a href=3D"http://www.pgrweb.go.cr/scij/Busqueda/Normativa/pronuncia=
miento/pro_ficha.aspx?param1=3DPRD&amp;param6=3D1&amp;nDictamen=3D22241&amp=
;strTipM=3DT" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer nofollow" class=
=3D"no-copy ms-1 inline text-nowrap print:hidden py-[2.5px] ps-2 pe-2 round=
ed-full align-[0.5px] bg-surface-l1 text-[13px] leading-none font-medium !t=
ext-fg-secondary hover:!text-fg-primary visited:text-fg-secondary focus:out=
line-none !no-underline hover:!no-underline citation" data-state=3D"closed"=
>=E2=81=A0Pgrweb</a></li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Accelera=
ted depreciation</strong> on short-lived assets, under the Income Tax Law.<=
/li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Language about <strong class=3D"font-sem=
ibold">municipal patents</strong> being granted for the activity =E2=80=94 =
that is access to the license, not a waiver of patente tax.</li>
</ol>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">What people still repeat from 1990s pitch decks, and should <stro=
ng class=3D"font-semibold">not</strong> be underwritten without a current H=
acienda/ICT letter:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Income-t=
ax holiday.</strong> Law 8114 attacked renta exemptions tied to this articl=
e. ICT=E2=80=99s live contract page does not list an income-tax exemption. =
A contract holder pays CIT like everyone else.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Property=
-tax (impuesto territorial) holiday.</strong> Older Art. 7 text had a <stro=
ng class=3D"font-semibold">6-year</strong> territorial-tax exemption for pr=
operties <strong class=3D"font-semibold">outside the Greater Metropolitan A=
rea</strong>. ICT=E2=80=99s current public contract benefits table does <st=
rong class=3D"font-semibold">not</strong> advertise it. Treat it as histori=
cal unless counsel finds it still operative on your parcel.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Free-zon=
e style 8-year CIT zero.</strong> That is Ley 7210, not 6990.</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><strong class=3D"font-semibold">Operatin=
g IVA off room and restaurant sales.</strong> Guests still pay 13%. You sti=
ll remit it.</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir=3D"auto" class=3D"font-semibold text-2xl mt-[1.5em] max-md:font-dis=
play max-md:text-heading-2 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0.17px] m=
ax-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">What the 7-year clock=
 actually buys a hostel</h2>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">If you clear classification and get a contract, the money is in <=
strong class=3D"font-semibold">build-out and FF&amp;E</strong>, not in the =
P&amp;L tax rate.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Examples that can matter:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Imported or locally bought beds, lockers=
, commercial kitchen line, water heaters, solar, treatment plant components=
, furniture, signage, construction materials for a declared expansion</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">IVA on that initial basket</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Examples that will not:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">The van and the gasoline</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Nightly IVA on $16 dorms</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Caja, aguinaldo, municipal patente as a =
% of gross</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Dividend WHT on the way out to a US owne=
r</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">For a cosmetic refresh of an already-running house, the =E2=80=9C=
initial investment=E2=80=9D window can be small. For a gut remodel or a new=
 build, it can be real =E2=80=94 thousands to tens of thousands of dollars,=
 not a change in Year-1 EBITDA margin.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Community rural tourism (Ley 8724) sits <em>on top</em> of 6990 f=
or qualifying family/community posadas: one-time relief on outboards, 4x4s =
/ 8=E2=80=9312 seat minibuses, and wastewater kit. That is a rural-communit=
y box, not a Barrio California party hostel.<a href=3D"https://www.ict.go.c=
r/en/institutional-services/tourism-contract-requirements.html" target=3D"_=
blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer nofollow" class=3D"no-copy ms-1 inline te=
xt-nowrap print:hidden py-[2.5px] ps-2 pe-2 rounded-full align-[0.5px] bg-s=
urface-l1 text-[13px] leading-none font-medium !text-fg-secondary hover:!te=
xt-fg-primary visited:text-fg-secondary focus:outline-none !no-underline ho=
ver:!no-underline citation" data-state=3D"closed">=E2=81=A0Ict</a></p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Law 10528 (2024) only adds an accessibility track: easier path in=
to declaration/contract plus duty relief on <strong class=3D"font-semibold"=
>accessibility equipment</strong>. Useful if you actually build it; not a g=
eneral capex coupon.</p>
<h2 dir=3D"auto" class=3D"font-semibold text-2xl mt-[1.5em] max-md:font-dis=
play max-md:text-heading-2 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0.17px] m=
ax-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">Declaration-only bene=
fits (still worth something)</h2>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">If you stop at declaratoria and never get a contract, you still g=
et:</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Official ICT lists and visitecostarica.c=
om</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Categorization</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Fair / co-op campaign access</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Training</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">A prerequisite checkbox for the contract=
</li>
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">For restaurants, ICT backing toward an =
=E2=80=9Cindefinite closure=E2=80=9D liquor patent =E2=80=94 still not the =
patent itself</li>
</ul>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">You do <strong class=3D"font-semibold">not</strong> get tax relie=
f. You do <strong class=3D"font-semibold">not</strong> get to skip Minister=
io de Salud, municipal uso de suelo, or Caja.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Separate regime: <strong class=3D"font-semibold">Ley 9742</strong=
> (hospedaje no tradicional / platforms) is the Airbnb registry. It is not =
6990, and it does not carry Art. 7 incentives.</p>
<h2 dir=3D"auto" class=3D"font-semibold text-2xl mt-[1.5em] max-md:font-dis=
play max-md:text-heading-2 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md:tracking-[0.17px] m=
ax-md:mb-3 max-md:mt-3 md:streamdown-last-block:mb-0">How this should sit i=
n the hostel model</h2>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Do <strong class=3D"font-semibold">not</strong> haircut CIT, IVA =
on rooms, or property tax in the base case.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" class=3D"break-words last:mb-0 max-md:leading-[155%] max-md=
:mb-4 max-md:last:mb-0 streamdown-first-block:mt-0" style=3D"white-space: p=
re-wrap;">Do run a <strong class=3D"font-semibold">capex scenario</strong>:=
</p>
<ul dir=3D"auto" class=3D"marker:text-secondary">
<li class=3D"break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-norma=
l [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Probability-weighted 6990 contract: 0 un=
