    <section id=3D"tab-entity" class=3D"tabpane hidden space-y-5">
      <div class=3D"kpi rounded-xl p-5 space-y-3">
        <h2 class=3D"text-lg font-semibold">What actually changes by wrappe=
r</h2>
        <p class=3D"text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Costa Rica taxe=
s <em>source</em>, not citizenship. A hostel in San Jos=C3=A9 or Tamarindo =
produces Costa Rican-source income regardless of whether the owner lives in=
 Easton, PA or Escaz=C3=BA. The United States taxes its citizens on worldwi=
de income and has <strong>no income-tax treaty</strong> with Costa Rica. Th=
at combination =E2=80=94 not the hostel=E2=80=99s bunk count =E2=80=94 driv=
es most of the entity decision.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"overflow-x-auto kpi rounded-xl p-4">
        <table class=3D"data w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class=3D"text-left py-2 pr-3">Topic</th>
              <th class=3D"text-left pr-3">US person, no CR company</th>
              <th class=3D"text-left pr-3">CR S.R.L. (preferred local form)=
</th>
              <th class=3D"text-left pr-3">CR S.A.</th>
              <th class=3D"text-left pr-3">US LLC owns CR S.R.L.</th>
              <th class=3D"text-left pr-3">US C-Corp owns CR S.R.L.</th>
              <th class=3D"text-left">Asociaci=C3=B3n / FBO</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class=3D"text-slate-300 align-top">
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">Formation</td>
              <td>C=C3=A9dula jur=C3=ADdica not required. Still need patent=
e, Ministerio de Salud, ICT lodging registration, Caja if you hire.</td>
              <td>One or more quotas. Manager (gerente), not a 3-person boa=
rd. Cheap, standard for expats.</td>
              <td>Board of directors + fiscal. Heavier minutes. Same tax as=
 S.R.L.</td>
              <td>Two-stack compliance. CR formation + US LLC + Form 5471 /=
 8865 depending on classification.</td>
              <td>Same stack plus C-Corp 1120.</td>
              <td>Asociaci=C3=B3n civil typically needs multiple founders (=
practice is ~10). Purpose must be non-profit.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">Can the American wo=
rk the desk?</td>
              <td colspan=3D"5">Ownership =E2=89=A0 work authorization. Tou=
rist status does not allow local labor. Inversionista ($150k qualifying inv=
estment, often titled in personal name) lets you live and manage your inves=
tment; it does not let you take a third-party CR job. Pensionado / rentista=
 are similarly restricted. A separate work category or permanent residency =
is required to be on payroll as an ordinary employee.</td>
              <td>Same immigration wall. A =E2=80=9Cministry=E2=80=9D label=
 does not create a work permit.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">CR income tax</td>
              <td>Persona f=C3=ADsica brackets 0=E2=80=9325% on CR-source n=
et. 2026 self-employed bands start exempt to =E2=82=A14.094m then 10 / 15 /=
 20 / 25%.</td>
              <td colspan=3D"2">Standard CIT 30% once the company is not in=
 the SME gross-income window. SME scale on <em>net</em> is 5 / 10 / 15 / 20=
% only if annual <em>gross</em> stays under the small-company ceiling (~=E2=
=82=A1119m in recent PwC tables; confirm each decree). Most 60-bed hostels =
with F&amp;B will leave the SME window quickly.</td>
              <td>CR sub pays CR CIT. Distributions face 15% WHT (5% only f=
or locally listed shares =E2=80=94 irrelevant here).</td>
              <td>Same CR layer.</td>
              <td>0% on exempt purpose income <em>if</em> Hacienda accepts =
public-utility / non-lucrative status. A hostel that sells beds, beer and t=
ours is a commercial activity. Expect CIT + IVA like everyone else unless c=
ounsel gets a rare ruling.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">IVA 13%</td>
              <td colspan=3D"6">Lodging under 30 days, restaurant, bar, lau=
ndry, tours sold in-house: 13%. You collect it, you remittance it. It is no=
t revenue. Long-term stays =E2=89=A530 days can be exempt. Platforms are be=
ing pulled into withholding (Airbnb 12.75% of payout flagged for late-2026;=
 Booking/Expedia already in the digital-services net for CR cards).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">Other CR frictions<=
/td>
              <td colspan=3D"5">Municipal patente (often a % of gross or a =
tariff schedule, paid quarterly). Property tax 0.25% of municipal appraisal=
 if you own. Transfer tax 1.5% on purchase. Annual Law 9428 company tax eve=
n on idle sociedades. ICT registration for tourist lodging. Guest book for =
Migraci=C3=B3n. Liquor patente if you run a real bar.</td>
              <td>Same commercial permits if you charge guests.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">US federal</td>
              <td>Schedule C if disregarded. FEIE (Form 2555) covers <em>ea=
rned</em> income for personal services abroad, 2026 cap $132,900, plus hous=
ing. If capital is a material income-producing factor, IRS limits earned in=
come to 30% of net profit. Pure rental / dividend character is not FEIE. SE=
 tax can apply on earned portion.</td>
              <td>Default corporation for CR law. IRS may treat S.R.L. as a=
 corp (Form 5471, GILTI if CFC) unless a check-the-box election made it a d=
isregarded entity or partnership when eligible. Dividends are not FEIE. FTC=
 for CR CIT + WHT.</td>
              <td>Almost always a foreign corporation. CFC / GILTI analysis=
 if US persons own &gt;50%.</td>
              <td>US LLC is usually a pass-through. Adds FBAR, 8938, and th=
e same 5471 on the CR sub. Does not erase GILTI.</td>
              <td>Classic double tax: CR CIT + 15% WHT + US 21% on residual=
 with FTC haircuts.</td>
              <td>US 501(c)(3) is a separate determination. A CR asociaci=
=C3=B3n is not automatically a US charity. Deductible donations need equiva=
lency or further IRS work.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class=3D"py-3 font-medium text-white">When this is ration=
al</td>
              <td>Tiny operation, owner on site with residency, wants simpl=
icity.</td>
              <td>Default for a real hostel. Liability box + local banking =
+ payroll.</td>
              <td>Only if investors demand S.A. form.</td>
              <td>US partners, US banking, or estate planning. Costly paper=
work.</td>
              <td>Rarely for a single hostel.</td>
              <td>Only if the project is actually a mission with restricted=
 surplus =E2=80=94 not a yield vehicle.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class=3D"kpi rounded-xl p-5">
          <h3 class=3D"font-semibold text-mint">Incentives that are real</h=
3>
          <ul class=3D"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 list-disc pl-5=
">
            <li>Law 6990 (Incentivos para el Desarrollo Tur=C3=ADstico) can=
 waive import duties on FF&amp;E and grant other relief <em>after</em> an I=
CT Declaratoria Tur=C3=ADstica / contrato tur=C3=ADstico. That is a hotel-g=
rade filing, not a weekend patent.</li>
            <li>Law 9996 investor / retiree package: $150k qualifying inves=
tment can support inversionista residency; household-goods / vehicle import=
 relief has been time-limited (verify current decree =E2=80=94 the 2026 win=
dow has been discussed through mid-year).</li>
            <li>MEIC micro/small CIT holidays exist for registered PYMEs (0=
% years 1=E2=80=933, then partial). A capitalized tourist lodging business =
often fails the spirit or the size test.</li>
            <li>Hiring locals is not optionally =E2=80=9Cincentivized=E2=80=
=9D; it is mandatory if you want legal labor. Caja inscription is the price=
 of a work force.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"kpi rounded-xl p-5">
          <h3 class=3D"font-semibold text-gold">Incentives that get oversol=
d</h3>
          <ul class=3D"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 list-disc pl-5=
">
            <li>There is no automatic income-tax holiday for =E2=80=9Cbring=
ing tourism.=E2=80=9D Free-zone / Ley 7210 is for exporters and qualified s=
ervice companies, not a Barrio California bunkhouse.</li>
            <li>Faith-based or nonprofit clothing does not zero-out IVA or =
let you skip Caja.</li>
            <li>US FEIE is not a 100% shield on hostel profit. Capital in t=
he building caps the earned slice; distributions from a sociedad are divide=
nds.</li>
            <li>Foreigners already may title ordinary (non-maritime-zone) r=
eal estate in their own name. A company is optional for ownership, useful f=
or liability and banking.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

