    <section id=3D"tab-labor" class=3D"tabpane hidden space-y-4">
      <div class=3D"kpi rounded-xl p-5">
        <h2 class=3D"text-lg font-semibold">2026 labor load =E2=80=94 the p=
art Gemini flattened</h2>
        <p class=3D"text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2">Employer social charges ro=
se on 1 Jan 2026 because IVM went from 5.42% to 5.58%. Headline employer pa=
ckage is <strong>26.83%</strong> if you include INA (1.50%, skipped under 5=
 workers), FODESAF 5%, IMAS 0.50%, Banco Popular slices, FCL 1.50%, complem=
entary pension 2.00%, and ~1% INS riesgos del trabajo (activity-rated). Tha=
t 26.83% is <em>not</em> the fully loaded cost. Aguinaldo is a 13th month (=
8.33% of base, paid 1=E2=80=9320 December). Vacaciones are two weeks after =
50 weeks. Many operators also reserve cesant=C3=ADa. A working planning fac=
tor is <strong>base =C3=97 1.38 to 1.45</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"overflow-x-auto kpi rounded-xl p-4">
        <table class=3D"data w-full text-sm">
